      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "As a huge fan of forums, the popularity and use of said forums has declined heavily over the last few years. With that in mind, VRChat would benefit greatly from the format that they provide, and we'd be able to foster active users. I think we should try not to split the community between too many communication platforms, but forums should be included.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
